---
import Logo from "./Logo.astro";
---

<footer class="border-t border-border pt-12 pb-10 md:pb-9 mb-16 md:mb-0">
  <div class="max-w-[1160px] mx-auto px-5 sm:px-7">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1fr] gap-8 mb-10">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-3.5">
          <Logo size={28} />
          <span class="font-display font-extrabold text-lg">XYBIT</span>
        </a>
        <p class="text-ink-faint text-[13.5px] max-w-[32ch]">Real trading education. No hype, just the fundamentals.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase text-ink-faint mb-3.5">Product</h4>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-sm text-ink-soft">
          <li><a href="#accounts" class="hover:text-ink">Accounts</a></li>
          <li><a href="#how" class="hover:text-ink">How it works</a></li>
          <li><a href="#payouts" class="hover:text-ink">Payouts</a></li>
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-ink">Affiliates</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase text-ink-faint mb-3.5">Company</h4>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-sm text-ink-soft">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-ink">Rules</a></li>
          <li><a href="#faq" class="hover:text-ink">FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-ink">Blog</a></li>
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-ink">Support</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-mono text-[11px] tracking-widest uppercase text-ink-faint mb-3.5">Legal</h4>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-sm text-ink-soft">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-ink">Terms</a></li>
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-ink">Risk Disclosure</a></li>
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-ink">Refund Policy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-ink">Privacy</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="border-t border-border pt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-start gap-5">
      <p class="text-[12px] text-ink-faint max-w-[56ch] leading-relaxed">
        Simulated capital. Trading involves risk. Past performance is not indicative of future
        results. Xybit accounts are evaluated on simulated funds; profit splits are paid from
        Xybit's own capital upon successful evaluation.
      </p>
      <div class="flex gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-border flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-ink-soft hover:border-accent hover:text-accent" aria-label="X">𝕏</a>
        <a href="/" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-border flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-ink-soft hover:border-accent hover:text-accent" aria-label="Instagram">IG</a>
        <a href="/" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-border flex items-center justify-center text-xs text-ink-soft hover:border-accent hover:text-accent" aria-label="Discord">D</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
